            "review_text": "1926yanks\nSeattle, Washington755 contributions\n0\nGreat Atmosphere & Food, Huge Menu\nApr 2025 • Friends\nI enjoy eating at a place in which Westerners are outnumbered by Vietnamese. The menu is far broader than just seafood. We had delicious grilled sliced beef, as well as a tasty & tender beef salad. The baked eggplant was an unusual dish. Also very good. The restaurant is a Ross from the river, and colorful lanterns on the main floor make for a festive feel.\nRead more\nWritten April 1, 2025",
